#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"View a list of your workloads on the [Workloads "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"
msgstr ""
"Consulta la lista de tus cargas de trabajo en la [página "
"Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View job status {#view-job-status}"
msgstr "Ver el estado de un job {#view-job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to your [Workloads table](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) and "
"check under the Status column for whether a job has completed or failed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ve a tu [tabla Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) y revisa "
"la columna Status para saber si un job se completó o falló.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View remaining usage {#view-remaining-usage}"
msgstr "Ver el uso restante {#view-remaining-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to your [Instances table](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) and "
"select the tab associated with the plan you want to view remaining usage "
"for. Total time used and total time remaining on your plan is displayed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ve a tu [tabla Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) y "
"selecciona la pestaña asociada al plan del que deseas ver el uso restante. "
"Se muestra el tiempo total utilizado y el tiempo total restante en tu "
"plan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"View metrics on number of jobs and workloads submitted {#view-metrics-on-"
"number-of-jobs-and-workloads-submitted}"
msgstr ""
"Ver métricas sobre el número de jobs y cargas de trabajo enviados {#view-"
"metrics-on-number-of-jobs-and-workloads-submitted}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to the [Analytics page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) to see "
"the total number of jobs submitted, as well as a count of batch workloads "
"and session workloads. Note that you can only see the Analytics page for "
"accounts that you own or manage.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ve a la [página Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) para ver"
" el número total de jobs enviados, así como el recuento de cargas de trabajo"
" en lote y en sesión. Ten en cuenta que solo puedes ver la página Analytics "
"para las cuentas que posees o administras.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Monitor a job {#monitor-a-job}"
msgstr "Monitorear un job {#monitor-a-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the job instance to check the job status or retrieve the results by "
"calling the appropriate command:\n"
msgstr ""
"Usa la instancia del job para verificar su estado o recuperar los resultados"
" llamando al comando apropiado:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|                               |                                                                                                                                                                                                              |\n"
"| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| job.result()                  | Review job results immediately after the job completes. Job results are available after the job completes. Therefore, job.result() is a blocking call until the job completes.                               |\n"
"| job.job\\_id()                 | Return the ID that uniquely identifies that job. Retrieving the job results at a later time requires the job ID. Therefore, it is recommended that you save the IDs of jobs you might want to retrieve later. |\n"
"| job.status()                  | Check the job status.                                                                                                                                                                                        |\n"
"| job = service.job(\\<job\\_id>) | Retrieve a job you previously submitted. This call requires the job ID.                                                                                                                                      |\n"
msgstr ""
"|                               |                                                                                                                                                                                                              |\n"
"| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| job.result()                  | Revisa los resultados del job inmediatamente después de que se complete. Los resultados están disponibles una vez que el job finaliza. Por lo tanto, job.result() es una llamada bloqueante hasta que el job se complete.                               |\n"
"| job.job\\_id()                 | Devuelve el ID que identifica de forma única ese job. Recuperar los resultados del job en un momento posterior requiere el ID del job. Por ello, se recomienda guardar los IDs de los jobs que puedas querer recuperar más adelante. |\n"
"| job.status()                  | Verifica el estado del job.                                                                                                                                                                                        |\n"
"| job = service.job(\\<job\\_id>) | Recupera un job enviado anteriormente. Esta llamada requiere el ID del job.                                                                                                                                      |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"retrieve-later\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"retrieve-later\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Retrieve job results at a later time {#retrieve-job-results-at-a-later-time}"
msgstr ""
"Recuperar resultados de un job en un momento posterior {#retrieve-job-"
"results-at-a-later-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Call `service.job(\\<job\\_id>)` to retrieve a job you previously submitted."
" If you don't have the job ID, or if you want to retrieve multiple jobs at "
"once; including jobs from retired QPUs (quantum processing units), call "
"`service.jobs()` with optional filters instead. See "
"[QiskitRuntimeService.jobs](../api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-"
"service#jobs).\n"
msgstr ""
"Llama a `service.job(\\<job\\_id>)` para recuperar un job que enviaste "
"anteriormente. Si no tienes el ID del job, o si deseas recuperar varios jobs"
" a la vez, incluidos jobs de QPUs (unidades de procesamiento cuántico) "
"retiradas, llama a `service.jobs()` con filtros opcionales. Consulta "
"[QiskitRuntimeService.jobs](../api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-"
"service#jobs).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Deprecated provider packages\">\n"
"  `service.jobs()` also returns jobs run from the deprecated `qiskit-ibm-provider` package. Jobs submitted by the older (also deprecated) `qiskit-ibmq-provider` package are no longer available.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Paquetes de proveedor obsoletos\">\n"
"  `service.jobs()` también devuelve jobs ejecutados desde el paquete obsoleto `qiskit-ibm-provider`. Los jobs enviados por el paquete más antiguo (también obsoleto) `qiskit-ibmq-provider` ya no están disponibles.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

